# platform.pico_epaper.display

The physical display provider for the Waveshare Pico-ePaper-2.66 carrier. It
owns the panel geometry, controller settings, and fixed GPIO/SPI wiring, then
registers the resulting SSD1680-family controller as mm.display.

Partial refresh remains disabled until its panel-specific LUT and recovery
sequence are qualified on hardware.
